rty-Five","startPage":508},{"label":"The Journey Home","startPage":509},{"label":"Chapter Forty-Six","startPage":516},{"label":"Across the Plains, to Home","startPage":517},{"label":"The Alex Hawk Time Travel Adventure","startPage":525},{"label":"concludes in","startPage":526},{"label":"Return from Kragdon-ah","startPage":527},{"label":"Available September 2020","startPage":528},{"label":"Author’s Note","startPage":529},{"label":"The Middle Falls Time Travel Series","startPage":534}],"chunked":true,"chunks":[{"id":"001","startPage":1,"endPage":50},{"id":"002","startPage":51,"endPage":100},{"id":"003","startPage":101,"endPage":150},{"id":"004","startPage":151,"endPage":200},{"id":"005","startPage":201,"endPage":250},{"id":"006","startPage":251,"endPage":300},{"id":"007","startPage":301,"endPage":350},{"id":"008","startPage":351,"endPage":400},{"id":"009","startPage":401,"endPage":450},{"id":"010","startPage":451,"endPage":500},{"id":"011","startPage":501,"endPage":534}],"glossary":[{"term":"This book is set in a world many millennia in the future. Thus, languages have evolved and none of our words have survived. The following is the naming conventions used throughout the book:","definition":""},{"term":"-ak  —","definition":"Male"},{"term":"-eh  —","definition":"Female"},{"term":"-ah  —","definition":"Geographic"},{"term":"-ta  —","definition":"Animal"},{"term":"Here are the most notable characters, animal names, geographic locations, and Kragdon-ah words:","definition":""},{"term":"Alecs-ta —","definition":"Beast of burden, much like a donkey."},{"term":"Alex Hawk  —","definition":"Former Special Forces member flung forward in time."},{"term":"Banda-ak   —","definition":"Husband of Ganku-eh. Died protecting Winten-ah."},{"term":"Batama-ah —","definition":"Mountain monastery and home of the holy men."},{"term":"Braka-ak   —","definition":"Member of the pirate force who gets left behind and shipwrecked."},{"term":"Dan Hadaller —","definition":"Fellow time traveler who was in Kragdon-ah before Alex Hawk."},{"term":"Denta-ah —","definition":"Tribe that used stama. Destroyed in A Door into Time."},{"term":"Det  —","definition":"“Yes,” in the universal language of Kragdon-ah"},{"term":"Dandra-ta —","definition":"Dragon-like creature that Alex must fight in Matori-ah."},{"term":"Doken-ak —","definition":"Alex Hawk’s first friend. Died at Denta-ah."},{"term":"Draka-ak —","definition":"Chieftain of the Lasta-ah."},{"term":"Duntas  —","definition":"Tiles used as currency in some areas of Kragdon-ah."},{"term":"Fenda-ak —","definition":"Servant to Preta-ah in Tonton-ah."},{"term":"Frina-eh —","definition":"Young healer in Matori-ah."},{"term":"Ganku-eh —","definition":"Once-chieftain of the Winten-ah."},{"term":"Grita-ta —","definition":"Fox."},{"term":"Godat-ta —","definition":"Grizzly bear."},{"term":"Grinta-ah —","definition":"City on the inland sea."},{"term":"Grunda-ta —","definition":"Coyote"},{"term":"Grunta-ak —","definition":"Mighty warrior from Rinta-ah who Alex must fight."},{"term":"Gunta  —","definition":"Hello, goodbye, I wish you well, in the universal language of Kragdon-ah."},{"term":"Harta-ak —","definition":"Captain of the barge that rescues Alex."},{"term":"Jabril-ak —","definition":"Son of Nanka-ak, who is chief of the Matori-ah."},{"term":"Kel  -","definition":"“No,” in the universal language of Kragdon-ah"},{"term":"Kilta-eh —","definition":"Healer of the Tonton-ah."},{"term":"Klaka-ah —","definition":"Town on Okrent-ah where weapons are made."},{"term":"Kragdon-ah —","definition":"The name of the entire world in the future."},{"term":"Kranda-ah —","definition":"The mighty river formerly known as The Columbia."},{"term":"Krista-ta —","definition":"Winten-ah for fish."},{"term":"Lanta-ah —","definition":"The Chosen One."},{"term":"Lasta-ah —","definition":"Actual name of the home of the kidnappers."},{"term":"Lusta-ah —","definition":"Original name Alex hears of the home of the kidnappers."},{"term":"Magda  —","definition":"Someone who complains a lot."},{"term":"Manta-ak —","definition":"Alex Hawk’s name in Kragdon-ah."},{"term":"Matori-ah —","definition":"Island village where Alex fights the dandra-ta."},{"term":"Monda-ak —","definition":"Gigantic dog. Loyal best friend to Alex Hawk."},{"term":"Nanka-ak —","definition":"Chieftain of Matori-ah."},{"term":"Niten-eh —","definition":"Healer of the Winten-ah."},{"term":"Okrent-ah —","definition":"Inland sea formed when the Great Lakes emptied."},{"term":"Otkan  —","definition":"An outcast."},{"term":"Preta-eh —","definition":"Chieftain of the Tonton-ah."},{"term":"Rapka-ah —","definition":"Small village on the Okrent-ah, close to Lasta-ah."},{"term":"Reggie  —","definition":"Fellow time traveler who travels Kragdon-ah as a bard."},{"term":"Rinka-ak —","definition":"Young chieftain of Rinta-ah."},{"term":"Ronit-ta —","definition":"Dire wolves"},{"term":"Rinta-ah —","definition":"Town beside the Kranda-ah that built the bridge across the river."},{"term":"Rundi-ak —","definition":"Spurned lover of Versa-eh, son of chief of unnamed village."},{"term":"Rutan-ta —","definition":"Mountain lion."},{"term":"Sekun-ak —","definition":"New chief of the Winten-ah. Close friend of Alex Hawk."},{"term":"Senta-eh —","definition":"Tall, beautiful warrior and bow fighter who travels with Alex Hawk."},{"term":"Stama  —","definition":"Kragdon-ah word for technology."},{"term":"Stinda-ta —","definition":"Alligator"},{"term":"Tinta-ak —","definition":"Massive warrior Alex defeated, who then became his biggest supporter."},{"term":"Tokin-ak —","definition":"Blind old wise man from Batama-ah."},{"term":"Tonton-ah —","definition":"Village built in the trees."},{"term":"Traka-ta —","definition":"Large pigeons."},{"term":"Trema-ak —","definition":"Monk from Batama-ah and friend of Alex."},{"term":"Untrin-ak —","definition":"Traveler Alex meets in Rinka-ak."},{"term":"Vanda-ak —","definition":"Winten-ah name for Dan Hadaller."},{"term":"Verda-eh —","definition":"Young woman in Tonton-ah who is close to Untrin-ak."},{"term":"Versa-eh —","definition":"Strong-willed young woman, daughter of The Trader."},{"term":"Werda-ak —","definition":"Teenage boy and tracker who travels with Alex Hawk."},{"term":"Winten-ah —","definition":"Cliffside home and name of the tribe Alex first meets."},{"term":"OceanofPDF.com","definition":"OceanofPDF.com"}]}